{"id":260,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Swampert predicts storms by sensing subtle differences in the sounds of waves and tidal winds with its fins. If a storm is approaching, it piles up boulders to protect itself."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Swampert is very strong. It has enough power to easily drag a boulder weighing more than a ton. This Pokémon also has powerful vision that lets it see even in murky water."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Its arms are hard as rock. With one swing, it can break a boulder into pieces."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"Its arms are rock-hard. With one swing, they can batter down its foe. It makes its nest on beautiful beaches."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"If it senses the approach of a storm and a tidal wave, it protects its seaside nest by piling up boulders. It swims as fast as a jet ski."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Torrent","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Water-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Damp","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon dampens its surroundings, preventing all Pokémon from using explosive moves such as Self-Destruct."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":258,"name":"Mudkip","condition":null,"children":[{"id":259,"name":"Marshtomp","condition":"Lv. 16","children":[{"id":260,"name":"Swampert","condition":"Lv. 36","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[1,55],[1,341],[9,88],[12,182],[15,48],[20,352],[25,157],[30,36],[35,133],[42,330],[49,103],[56,283],[63,56]],"machine":[133,419,59,776,34,280,339,523,886,174,91,38,414,89,283,203,263,374,812,411,264,416,9